{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54775","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军马进，月畔见三星。\n形似三星将月捧，攻城（京本作「围」）不下战无成，择地设营停（京本作「再安营」。\n候过旬日，别看气候。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}